                                "sense_id": "f3cf93c7-28aa-35f9-8db2-a28b1ac2efa7",
                                "text": "Bureaucracies frequently spawn euphemisms intentionally, as doublespeak expressions. For example, in the past, the US military used the term \"sunshine units\" for contamination by radioactive isotopes."
